// Index page: https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/hunting/harvest-reporting-information/
//   elk       "2021 New Mexico Elk Hunter Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2021-2022-elk-harvest-report/
//   elk       "2022 New Mexico Elk Hunter Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2022-2023-elk-harvest-report/
//   elk       "2023 New Mexico Elk Hunter Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2023-2024-elk-harvest-report/
//   elk       "2024 New Mexico Elk Hunter Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2024-2025-elk-harvest-report/
//   elk       "2025 New Mexico Elk Hunter Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2025-2026-elk-harvest-report/
//   deer      "2021-2022 Deer Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2021-2022-deer-harvest-report/
//   deer      "2022-2023 Deer Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2022-2023-deer-harvest-report/
//   deer      "2023-2024 Deer Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2023-2024-deer-harvest-report/
//   deer      "2024-2025 Deer Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2024-2025-deer-harvest-report/
//   deer      "2025-2026 Deer Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2025-2026-deer-harvest-report/
//   pronghorn "2022-2023 Pronghorn Harvest Report" (PDF title misprinted "2023-2023"; Aug. 14-16 2022 season dates)
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2022-2023-pronghorn-harvest-report/
//   pronghorn "2023-2024 Pronghorn Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2023-2024-pronghorn-harvest-report/
//   pronghorn "2024-2025 Pronghorn Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2024-2025-pronghorn-harvest-report/
//   pronghorn "2025-2026 Pronghorn Harvest Report"
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2025-2026-pronghorn-harvest-report/
//   bear      "Black Bear Mortality in New Mexico" by zone, Tables 10-14 (2021-2025)
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/annual-bear-mortality-by-zone-2025-2026/
//   lion      "Cougar Mortality in New Mexico" by zone, Tables 10-14 (2021-22 to 2025-26)
//             https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/annual-cougar-mortality-by-zone-2025-2026/
// Unit names: 19.30.4 NMAC "Boundary Descriptions for Game Management Units" — https://www.srca.nm.gov/parts/title19/19.030.0004.html
//   plus herd-unit names printed in the elk harvest reports.
// Draw/deadlines: 2026-2027 NM Hunting Rules & Info — https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/download/2026-2027-new-mexico-hunting-rules-and-info/
//   and https://wildlife.dgf.nm.gov/hunting/applications-and-draw-information/ (checked 2026-10-08; 2027-28 dates not yet published)
//
// Years covered (year = season/license year start):
//   elk 2021-2025 · mule-deer 2021-2025 · whitetail 2021-2025 · pronghorn 2022-2025
//   bear 2021-2025 (by bear zone) · lion 2021-2025 (by cougar zone)
// Method notes:
//   ELK: one row per GMU-level "Totals" line (public draw + private-land authorizations).
//     totalHarvest = estimated bulls + cows; totalHunters = licenses sold;
//     successRate = harvest / licenses sold (NMDOW's own % uses hunters who went afield).
//     Combined agency units kept as published: 16B/22 -> 16B-22, 29/30 -> 29-30 (GMU 30 in 2021-22),
//     39/43 -> 39-43 (GMU 43 in 2021-22), 57/58 -> 57-58. The "GMU 42/47/59" public-hunt block is
//     omitted because its private rows duplicate GMUs 42, 47 and 59.
//   DEER: NM deer licenses are mostly FAD (fork-antlered deer, mule OR white-tailed), so harvest is not
//     split by species. NM_WHITETAIL_DATA = sum of whitetail-only hunts (bag ESWTD/FAWTD) in a GMU;
//     NM_MULE_DEER_DATA = all other deer hunts (FAD/FAMD), i.e. may include some Coues/whitetail.
//     Where a GMU has no whitetail-only hunts, the published "GMU Total" line is used directly.
//     totalHunters = NMDOW "Estimated Hunters"; bulls/cows = bucks/does. Sub-areas (23 Burros,
//     55 Valle Vidal/Urraca/E.S. Barker, 55A/55B, 57 Sugarite) are summed into the parent GMU.
//   PRONGHORN: one row per published "GMU Total" (agency groups kept, e.g. 2-7-9-10);
//     totalHunters = licenses sold (2022-23 reports have no estimated-hunter column).
//   BEAR / LION: sport harvest only (female + male + unknown); depredation, road-kill and
//     bighorn-sheep-protection removals excluded. Hunter numbers are not published by zone ->
//     totalHunters 0 / successRate 0 (unknown). bulls = males, cows = females.
//   Bighorn sheep: reported only by statewide hunt code (BHS-1-201 etc.), not by unit — no rows.
// ============================================================

